sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant Site as janus-soft.com
    participant A1 as Agent 1 Discovery
    participant DB as Postgres (events, outreach)
    participant A4 as Agent 4 Orchestrator
    participant A2 as Agent 2 Matching
    participant A3 as Agent 3 Drafting
    participant R as Recruiter
    participant SES as Sender (SES / outbox)
    participant C as Candidate

    A1->>Site: GET /career and each /jobs/NNNN
    A1->>DB: upsert job + insert JobCreated (one transaction)
    A4->>DB: claim JobCreated
    A4->>A2: deliver
    A2->>DB: score every confirmed, opted-in candidate
    A2->>DB: upsert outreach(status=matched) + MatchFound, for coverage ≥ 0.80
    A4->>A3: deliver MatchFound
    A3->>A3: fill template, optional one-line "why you" from matched lines
    A4->>A3: QA gate: no clearance, no external_req, link present, unsubscribe present
    A3->>DB: outreach(status=pending_approval) + DraftReady
    R->>DB: open /admin/outreach, edit, Approve
    DB-->>A4: DraftApproved
    A4->>A4: re-check: job still open, candidate still opted in, rate limit
    A4->>SES: send with List-Unsubscribe
    SES-->>C: email
    SES-->>A4: message id
    A4->>DB: outreach(status=sent) + EmailSent + audit_log
